WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two numbers arrive between letters. Why can the second vanish from our answer?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers call it the attentional blink: a limit on rapid target reporting.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
After intensive meditation training, one 2007 study observed a smaller blink.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But it did not test commercial audio, and it did not prove a shortcut.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Start with a free twelve-minute routine. Record what you actually finish.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
If you consider paid audio, check contents, claims and terms first.
